[i]You can't really sleep after the fight earlier. You toss and turn in bed, worrying about {Silas.name}. You look at your bedside clock. its around midnight. Suddenly, there's a knock on the door.[/i]
[i]You get out of bed and look through the peephole in the door. {FoShi.name} is on the other side.[/i]
- Open the door
	label Door Open
	[i]You open the door.[/i]
	FoShi: "{Player_name}, do you have time? I would like to talk about {Silas.name}."
	- "Yeah, I can talk."
		Player: "Yeah, I can talk. I ahven't relaly been able to sleep after he left."
		FoShi: "That is... unfortunate. I do wish that he had not left so suddenly. Maybe then we would have been able to make up for the past."
		FoShi: "I came here to tell you that I intend to go look for him tomorrow."
	- "I'm sorry, but I'm very tired."
		Player: "I'm sorry, but I'm very tired. I would like to get some sleep."
		FoShi: "That is understandable. I will let you know that I intend to search for {Silas.name} tomorrow."
	<Empty Text Event>
	- "I hope that you find him."
		Player: "I hope that you find him. I've been worried about him all night."
		FoShi: "I hope so as well. I do not feel well knowing that he is out there because of my presence here."
	- "It's dangerous outside."
		Player: "It's dangerous outside. You could get hurt."
		FoShi: "I am aware. However, I know how to handle myself. I am confident that I will be able to find him."
	FoShi: "I will leave now, unless you wish to talk more?"
	- "Talk about what?"
		Player: "What did you want to talk about?"
		FoShi: "I like to ask people what they plan to do in this new world. I find that it helps me to know people better and gives me a judge of their character."
		Player: "Sure. I don't mind answering that."
		FoShi: "Very well. I will repeat it in a more concise manner. What do you plan to do in this new world?"
		- "I'd like to rebuild some sort of society."
			Player: "I'd like to rebuild some sort of society."
			FoShi: "That is a noble endeavor. I personally find that organized groups can lead to harm of those outside of the group and sometimes to those inside the group as well. However, I believe that you are of good character."
		- "Hopefully I can meet more people."
			Player: "Hopefully I can meet more people."
			FoShi: "Meeting new people is a good goal to have. Having strong allies and friends can be a boon in these times."
		- "I'm fine with living how I am now."
			Player: "I suppose I'm fine with living how I am now. I don't think I'd change much."
			FoShi: "Satisfaction with what you have is a great accomplishment, though you do already have a lot. However, you should be proud of what you have. It is a good thing to have food stores."
		- "I don't really know. I haven't thought about it too much."
			Player: "I don't really know. I haven't thought about it too much."
			FoShi: "I suppose you might not have, but regardless, you don't really need to. Planning for the future is something that isn't nessesary now."
		FoShi: "Well, I have become quite tired now, so I will leave. Have a good night."
		[i]{Fo'Shi.name} leaves your room, and returns to the room he is staying in. You close the door and go back to bed.[/i]
